"To fortify the Valmont-Nordic board's governance oversight and shield directors against personal liability exposure, this opinion recommends four mandatory boardroom safeguards: first, establishing a formal 'Mission-Critical Risk & Red-Flag Escalation Charter' requiring direct quarterly reporting to the Board Risk Committee from Compliance, Internal Audit, Cybersecurity, and Safety heads without CEO filtering; second, instituting rigorous 'Board Minute Documentation Standards' recording independent challenge, alternative options weighed, and expert advice obtained; third, conducting quarterly solvency and liquidity stress tests whenever net leverage exceeds 3.0 times EBITDA; and fourth, securing dedicated, ring-fenced 'Side-A DIC D&O insurance' for non-executive directors.",
